{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01118",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 8.35,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Okay, doctor, we're all set in here. I'll give you the numbers when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.44,
      "end_seconds": 15.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Thanks. Hello, come in, sit down. What brings you in today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.11,
      "end_seconds": 25.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "I'm, I'm here because of a sore ankle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.77,
      "end_seconds": 31.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.17,
      "end_seconds": 34.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "About... well, three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.9,
      "end_seconds": 41.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.99,
      "end_seconds": 55.05,
      "duration_seconds": 12.06,
      "text": "It settles a little with rest. Severe, really. And a little swelling, too. Oh, about little swelling, elevation helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.26,
      "end_seconds": 63.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Have you had a sore ankle before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.16,
      "end_seconds": 71.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "A bit, a couple of years ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 84.47,
      "end_seconds": 95.12,
      "duration_seconds": 10.65,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Heart rate 77, temperature is 37.0 degrees, oxygen saturation is 98 percent. Pressure 114 over 73, respiratory rate 15."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.59,
      "end_seconds": 101.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.83,
      "end_seconds": 107.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.11,
      "end_seconds": 110.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.4,
      "end_seconds": 113.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.82,
      "end_seconds": 134.66,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "There's mild swelling over the outside of the ankle, and you can put your weight on it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.39,
      "end_seconds": 146.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. Did you get pain in the foot, numbness or crack or pop?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.28,
      "end_seconds": 152.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "No, you know, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.76,
      "end_seconds": 157.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.6,
      "end_seconds": 162.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.75,
      "end_seconds": 167.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.13,
      "end_seconds": 181.85,
      "duration_seconds": 12.72,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.65,
      "end_seconds": 185.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.92,
      "end_seconds": 189.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "No surgery, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.38,
      "end_seconds": 193.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.29,
      "end_seconds": 202.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.58,
      "end_seconds": 208.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.34,
      "end_seconds": 220.92,
      "duration_seconds": 10.58,
      "text": "Well, I've had asthma, yes. Low haemoglobin, for about ten years. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.04,
      "end_seconds": 225.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Alright, asthma, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.96,
      "end_seconds": 244.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.04,
      "end_seconds": 253.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I take Foracort inhaler, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.43,
      "end_seconds": 256.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "And for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.93,
      "end_seconds": 267.27,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "For about three months. I'm, I'm on iron tablets, once a day for my blood count. Ibuprofen gel, three times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.84,
      "end_seconds": 281.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, this looks most like a mild ankle sprain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.32,
      "end_seconds": 287.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Okay, so I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.3,
      "end_seconds": 308.04,
      "duration_seconds": 18.74,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a mild ankle sprain, and we'll watch how it goes. Rest, ice, a compression bandage and keep it raised for two days. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.43,
      "end_seconds": 312.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I mean, thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.61,
      "end_seconds": 315.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}